3. **Retry Logic** - Implement exponential backoff retry logic for network failures:

```java
public class RetryUtil {
    public static <T> T retryWithBackoff(int maxRetries, Supplier<T> supplier) throws Exception {
        int attempts = 0;
        boolean success = false;
        while (!success && attempts < maxRetries) {
            try {
                success = supplier.get() != null; // return value check or exception thrown by the supplier
            } catch (Exception e) {
                Thread.sleep(Math.pow(2, attempts) * 100);
            }
            attempts++;
        }
        if (!success && attempts == maxRetries) throw new RuntimeException("Failed to execute after maximum retries");
        return supplier.get();
    }
}
```

